{"ep": "11", "idx": 0, "start": "0:00:22.87", "end": "0:00:24.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不可以动他"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 1, "start": "0:00:28.38", "end": "0:00:29.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "他已经逝世了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 2, "start": "0:00:30.64", "end": "0:00:32.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是水果刀啊"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 3, "start": "0:00:36.99", "end": "0:00:38.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "出大事了呢"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 4, "start": "0:00:47.45", "end": "0:00:48.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 5, "start": "0:00:48.98", "end": "0:00:50.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "记事本被刺穿了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 6, "start": "0:00:51.20", "end": "0:00:54.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看来犯人是个相当有腕力的人"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 7, "start": "0:00:55.27", "end": "0:00:59.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也就是说  应该认为犯人是男性没错吧"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 8, "start": "0:01:00.49", "end": "0:01:04.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还有  找不到多丸裕先生的话…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 9, "start": "0:01:05.28", "end": "0:01:07.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这件事对你妹妹…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 10, "start": "0:01:07.80", "end": "0:01:09.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "最好不要说对吧"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 11, "start": "0:01:10.51", "end": "0:01:13.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看来是个应该稍下功夫考虑的情形呢"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 12, "start": "0:01:14.98", "end": "0:01:17.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个情况正是所谓的「Closed Circle」"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 13, "start": "0:01:14.98", "end": "0:01:17.93", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "（Closed Circle：封闭轨道，具体说明见前篇）"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 14, "start": "0:01:18.46", "end": "0:01:20.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一眼看去就能明白是一起他杀事件"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 15, "start": "0:01:21.43", "end": "0:01:24.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "再加上这间屋子是一间密室"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 16, "start": "0:01:26.51", "end": "0:01:29.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那么  犯人是怎样在无法出入的房间中"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 17, "start": "0:01:29.89", "end": "0:01:32.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "施行犯罪行为并顺利逃脱的呢？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 18, "start": "0:03:11.89", "end": "0:03:14.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂  阿虚  发生了什么事吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 19, "start": "0:03:14.60", "end": "0:03:15.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我不是说了吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 20, "start": "0:03:15.86", "end": "0:03:18.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "圭一先生因为急病而卧床休息去了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 21, "start": "0:03:18.29", "end": "0:03:20.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以必须老老实实留在房间里"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 22, "start": "0:03:20.44", "end": "0:03:22.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是  为什么连实玖瑠也…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 23, "start": "0:03:29.20", "end": "0:03:29.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 24, "start": "0:03:30.12", "end": "0:03:30.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来一下"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 25, "start": "0:03:33.44", "end": "0:03:35.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有希  把门锁好"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 26, "start": "0:03:35.57", "end": "0:03:37.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不论什么人来都不能开哦！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 27, "start": "0:03:37.93", "end": "0:03:39.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我知道了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 28, "start": "0:03:43.02", "end": "0:03:44.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是杀人事件吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 29, "start": "0:03:44.93", "end": "0:03:46.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不管怎么说就是如此了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 30, "start": "0:03:47.21", "end": "0:03:51.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么会这样…我从没想过会发生这种事"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 31, "start": "0:03:51.55", "end": "0:03:54.69", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你不是总是说热切期待发生事件吗…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 32, "start": "0:03:55.02", "end": "0:03:57.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是  我没想到真的会发生啊！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 33, "start": "0:03:58.42", "end": "0:04:01.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在暴风雨袭击的孤岛上发生的密室杀人"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 34, "start": "0:04:01.38", "end": "0:04:06.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在旅行地点偶然碰到这种事情的概率有多少？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 35, "start": "0:04:06.54", "end": "0:04:10.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "难道说这也是因为春日的希望而发生的吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 36, "start": "0:04:11.64", "end": "0:04:13.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这下事情可伤脑筋了…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 37, "start": "0:04:14.80", "end": "0:04:16.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就像是一个本来只是在愚人节开玩笑"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 38, "start": "0:04:17.32", "end": "0:04:20.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "却没想到玩笑成真而烦恼不已的恶作剧小鬼一样"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 39, "start": "0:04:21.29", "end": "0:04:23.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然不愿意这么想…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 40, "start": "0:04:23.61", "end": "0:04:25.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "最大的嫌疑人是裕先生吧"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 41, "start": "0:04:26.11", "end": "0:04:28.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不管怎么说  他已经失踪了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 42, "start": "0:04:28.66", "end": "0:04:31.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "说起来  昨天实玖瑠说过"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 43, "start": "0:04:38.89", "end": "0:04:40.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "他们两个人在吵架？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 44, "start": "0:04:40.60", "end": "0:04:42.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看起来好像是这个样子"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 45, "start": "0:04:42.27", "end": "0:04:44.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还有一件事是昨天晚上"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 46, "start": "0:04:45.50", "end": "0:04:47.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "玩游戏的时候我不是去上过一次厕所吗"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 47, "start": "0:04:48.42", "end": "0:04:50.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个时候  正好就在这里…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 48, "start": "0:04:50.65", "end": "0:04:51.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对  快一点"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 49, "start": "0:04:52.17", "end": "0:04:54.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "给我准备好护照和旅游支票"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 50, "start": "0:04:55.07", "end": "0:04:56.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在想来"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 51, "start": "0:04:56.37", "end": "0:04:59.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那可能是在做潜逃外国的准备呢！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 52, "start": "0:04:59.75", "end": "0:05:01.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是为什么要做成密室？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 53, "start": "0:05:01.71", "end": "0:05:03.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也没有做伪装成自杀的样子"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 54, "start": "0:05:04.14", "end": "0:05:06.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没有理由特地做成密室啊"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 55, "start": "0:05:08.09", "end": "0:05:10.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯  毕竟不能在这里无所事事"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 56, "start": "0:05:10.68", "end": "0:05:13.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "再去好好看一看圭一先生的房间吧！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 57, "start": "0:05:13.76", "end": "0:05:15.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "联络警察的时候"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 58, "start": "0:05:16.25", "end": "0:05:19.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对方要求不允许任何人进去"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 59, "start": "0:05:20.33", "end": "0:05:21.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "警察什么时候才会来？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 60, "start": "0:05:22.14", "end": "0:05:27.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "根据预报  预计明天下午天气就会转好"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 61, "start": "0:05:27.36", "end": "0:05:30.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大概就是那个时候吧"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 62, "start": "0:05:30.47", "end": "0:05:32.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "房门一整晚都锁着吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 63, "start": "0:05:32.57", "end": "0:05:33.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个很难得知"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 64, "start": "0:05:34.10", "end": "0:05:36.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为我只是敲了敲门而已"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 65, "start": "0:05:36.42", "end": "0:05:37.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只是敲了？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 66, "start": "0:05:37.49", "end": "0:05:41.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为圭一老爷的房间里面有工作上的文件"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 67, "start": "0:05:42.01", "end": "0:05:45.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因此是不允许没有回应就擅自进去的"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 68, "start": "0:05:46.12", "end": "0:05:48.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "圭一先生和裕先生之间的关系不好吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 69, "start": "0:05:51.81", "end": "0:05:53.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这我也并不清楚"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 70, "start": "0:05:54.34", "end": "0:06:01.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不管怎么说  我和森在这里服务也只有最近一星期而已"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 71, "start": "0:06:02.09", "end": "0:06:03.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一星期？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 72, "start": "0:06:03.40", "end": "0:06:08.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们是兼职的  是临时雇用的管家和女仆"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 73, "start": "0:06:09.09", "end": "0:06:13.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "签订的合同也只有这个夏天很短的一段时间  仅仅二周而已"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 74, "start": "0:06:15.00", "end": "0:06:16.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也就是说你只在这栋别墅里工作？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 75, "start": "0:06:16.78", "end": "0:06:19.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "并不是以前就跟随圭一先生的了？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 76, "start": "0:06:19.37", "end": "0:06:20.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "正是如此"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 77, "start": "0:06:20.69", "end": "0:06:22.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "关于兄弟两人的关系"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 78, "start": "0:06:22.90", "end": "0:06:27.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也只知道裕先生是圭一老爷公司里的职员而已"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 79, "start": "0:06:29.04", "end": "0:06:30.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有点不对劲"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 80, "start": "0:06:34.13", "end": "0:06:37.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这异样的感觉…是什么？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 81, "start": "0:06:39.98", "end": "0:06:41.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "咦？古泉！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 82, "start": "0:06:41.84", "end": "0:06:42.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你在做什么？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 83, "start": "0:06:43.57", "end": "0:06:45.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我在房子里走了一圈"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 84, "start": "0:06:45.79", "end": "0:06:47.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "到处都找不到裕先生"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 85, "start": "0:06:47.88", "end": "0:06:48.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你们两位呢？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 86, "start": "0:06:48.80", "end": "0:06:51.43", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去外面  我们要去确认船是否还在"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 87, "start": "0:06:51.63", "end": "0:06:53.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我想船应该已经不在了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 88, "start": "0:06:53.57", "end": "0:06:54.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 89, "start": "0:06:54.81", "end": "0:06:56.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是昨天晚上的事情"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 90, "start": "0:06:56.45", "end": "0:06:59.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我看到裕先生好像急着要去做什么事"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 91, "start": "0:06:59.73", "end": "0:07:01.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "向玄关方向走去"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 92, "start": "0:07:02.05", "end": "0:07:05.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你的意思是说  裕先生已经夺走船离开了这座岛吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 93, "start": "0:07:06.30", "end": "0:07:07.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然并不肯定"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 94, "start": "0:07:08.41", "end": "0:07:11.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是  这是我最后一次见到裕先生"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 95, "start": "0:07:12.22", "end": "0:07:13.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是什么时候的事？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 96, "start": "0:07:13.40", "end": "0:07:15.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我想是大约凌晨一点左右"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 97, "start": "0:07:25.98", "end": "0:07:26.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要是一个不小心"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 98, "start": "0:07:27.04", "end": "0:07:28.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就会掉下悬崖了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 99, "start": "0:07:28.71", "end": "0:07:29.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "算了  感觉就算掉下去"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 100, "start": "0:07:30.05", "end": "0:07:33.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只要跟这个家伙在一起  生还的几率就很大"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 101, "start": "0:07:33.38", "end": "0:07:34.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你看  阿虚！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 102, "start": "0:07:34.71", "end": "0:07:37.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "快艇不在  果然是裕先生做的吗"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 103, "start": "0:07:38.61", "end": "0:07:40.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "灰色的天空  黑色的大海"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 104, "start": "0:07:41.16", "end": "0:07:43.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "令我想起前一阵子经历过的封闭空间"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 105, "start": "0:07:44.79", "end": "0:07:48.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我完全无法喜欢上这种单色的世界"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 106, "start": "0:07:48.07", "end": "0:07:48.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 107, "start": "0:07:48.76", "end": "0:07:49.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那边有人！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 108, "start": "0:07:50.02", "end": "0:07:51.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就在那里  岩石的后面！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 109, "start": "0:07:52.50", "end": "0:07:55.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是有人出来了吗？还是…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 110, "start": "0:07:56.16", "end": "0:07:56.86", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也许是真正的犯人！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 111, "start": "0:07:56.86", "end": "0:07:57.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂！等一下！春日！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 112, "start": "0:08:03.01", "end": "0:08:05.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我说  他真的跑到这里来了吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 113, "start": "0:08:05.45", "end": "0:08:07.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为没有别的路了不是吗…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 114, "start": "0:08:08.62", "end": "0:08:09.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 115, "start": "0:08:19.48", "end": "0:08:20.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 116, "start": "0:08:20.92", "end": "0:08:21.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 117, "start": "0:08:21.89", "end": "0:08:22.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 118, "start": "0:08:23.11", "end": "0:08:25.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  你没事吧？还活着吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 119, "start": "0:08:26.17", "end": "0:08:27.84", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…嗯  大概吧"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 120, "start": "0:08:29.69", "end": "0:08:31.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看起来糟糕了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 121, "start": "0:08:33.60", "end": "0:08:34.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是啊…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 122, "start": "0:08:35.89", "end": "0:08:37.87", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看起来没办法回到原来的路上了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 123, "start": "0:08:39.08", "end": "0:08:40.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你看  那里"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 124, "start": "0:08:42.33", "end": "0:08:45.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "很幸运地  洞穴里面很温暖"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 125, "start": "0:08:45.88", "end": "0:08:46.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也许是地热的缘故"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 126, "start": "0:08:47.40", "end": "0:08:49.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "或者是因为有温泉的水脉"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 127, "start": "0:08:50.41", "end": "0:08:52.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个黑影到底是什么？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 128, "start": "0:08:52.89", "end": "0:08:54.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真的是生物吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 129, "start": "0:08:54.99", "end": "0:08:56.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不会是看错了吧？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 130, "start": "0:08:56.74", "end": "0:08:58.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不会的！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 131, "start": "0:08:58.73", "end": "0:09:00.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "…我想是不会的"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 132, "start": "0:09:02.67", "end": "0:09:03.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我说  阿虚"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 133, "start": "0:09:03.85", "end": "0:09:07.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真的是裕先生杀了圭一先生吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 134, "start": "0:09:07.37", "end": "0:09:08.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么意思啊？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 135, "start": "0:09:08.76", "end": "0:09:10.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "刚才我就一直在想"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 136, "start": "0:09:11.01", "end": "0:09:12.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "根据森小姐的证言"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 137, "start": "0:09:12.85", "end": "0:09:16.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "裕先生离开岛不是昨天深夜么"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 138, "start": "0:09:16.81", "end": "0:09:19.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是我刚才碰到圭一先生的时候"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 139, "start": "0:09:19.64", "end": "0:09:21.47", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "尸体还是温热的"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 140, "start": "0:09:21.81", "end": "0:09:22.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你明白这是什么意思吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 141, "start": "0:09:23.01", "end": "0:09:27.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也就是说  我们发现的时候  圭一先生刚死不久"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 142, "start": "0:09:28.83", "end": "0:09:29.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是怎么回事？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 143, "start": "0:09:30.49", "end": "0:09:32.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "裕先生在刮着台风的夜晚离开别墅"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 144, "start": "0:09:32.90", "end": "0:09:36.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "先隐藏在什么地方  然后才刺死圭一先生逃走的吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 145, "start": "0:09:37.03", "end": "0:09:37.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我想不是"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 146, "start": "0:09:38.33", "end": "0:09:43.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就算圭一先生被杀是在我们找到他一小时左右以前"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 147, "start": "0:09:43.66", "end": "0:09:47.63", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那个时候大家也已经起床  在房子里面到处走动了不是吗"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 148, "start": "0:09:47.98", "end": "0:09:49.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "既没听到怪声也没听到惨叫"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 149, "start": "0:09:49.96", "end": "0:09:50.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "太不自然了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 150, "start": "0:09:51.13", "end": "0:09:52.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是很奇怪啊"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 151, "start": "0:09:52.67", "end": "0:09:54.56", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "难道说圭一先生胸口被刀刺中之后"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 152, "start": "0:09:54.79", "end": "0:09:58.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "又生存了好几个小时  还自己把门锁上了吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 153, "start": "0:09:59.20", "end": "0:10:01.19", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而且如果裕先生不是犯人的话"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 154, "start": "0:10:01.25", "end": "0:10:02.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "他也没理由逃…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 155, "start": "0:10:01.49", "end": "0:10:02.14", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "等一下！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 156, "start": "0:10:03.17", "end": "0:10:04.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我明白了！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 157, "start": "0:10:04.70", "end": "0:10:07.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我明白事情的真相了…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 158, "start": "0:10:09.15", "end": "0:10:10.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂  你在听我说吗？阿虚"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 159, "start": "0:10:11.04", "end": "0:10:12.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "听着呢  总之你先说说看"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 160, "start": "0:10:15.23", "end": "0:10:18.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "裕先生刺了圭一先生这一点不会错"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 161, "start": "0:10:18.36", "end": "0:10:22.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "否则的话就像你说的一样  他没有理由逃跑"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 162, "start": "0:10:22.44", "end": "0:10:23.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "唔…的确是这样"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 163, "start": "0:10:24.10", "end": "0:10:26.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然不知道出了什么事情"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 164, "start": "0:10:26.32", "end": "0:10:28.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "裕先生刺了圭一先生"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 165, "start": "0:10:28.64", "end": "0:10:30.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我想应该不会是有计划的杀人"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 166, "start": "0:10:30.59", "end": "0:10:31.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大概就是在吵架的时候一时怒上心头"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 167, "start": "0:10:31.99", "end": "0:10:35.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就随手抓起旁边的水果刀没有多想就挥了过去之类吧"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 168, "start": "0:10:36.27", "end": "0:10:39.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是小刀没有刺到心脏"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 169, "start": "0:10:43.89", "end": "0:10:47.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "小刀被记事本挡住  没有形成致命伤"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 170, "start": "0:10:47.73", "end": "0:10:50.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是  这时出现了麻烦的事情"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 171, "start": "0:10:50.93", "end": "0:10:53.65", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "圭一先生因为震惊而立刻晕倒了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 172, "start": "0:10:54.03", "end": "0:10:57.55", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看到这幅情景  裕先生便以为自己杀了人"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 173, "start": "0:10:58.31", "end": "0:10:59.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "问题是之后的事情"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 174, "start": "0:11:00.03", "end": "0:11:04.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "其实只是晕倒的圭一先生一直昏厥到了早晨"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 175, "start": "0:11:05.26", "end": "0:11:09.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "醒来的圭一先生意识不清地站了起来"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 176, "start": "0:11:09.49", "end": "0:11:11.72", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "想起弟弟刺杀自己的事情"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 177, "start": "0:11:12.00", "end": "0:11:15.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在昏昏沉沉中把门锁上了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 178, "start": "0:11:17.31", "end": "0:11:19.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "悲剧的发生就在这之后"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 179, "start": "0:11:19.60", "end": "0:11:21.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "圭一先生脚下一个不稳"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 180, "start": "0:11:22.23", "end": "0:11:24.21", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就这样前倾着倒了下去"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 181, "start": "0:11:25.56", "end": "0:11:28.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "结果  刀子刺入了胸部更深的地方"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 182, "start": "0:11:28.67", "end": "0:11:30.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "夺走了圭一先生的生命"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 183, "start": "0:11:31.44", "end": "0:11:32.54", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这就是真相"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 184, "start": "0:11:32.92", "end": "0:11:35.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "等一下  会发生这么凑巧的事情吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 185, "start": "0:11:36.24", "end": "0:11:38.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "问题是就是这么发生的  不是也没办法吗"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 186, "start": "0:11:38.24", "end": "0:11:40.10", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还能想到别的可能性吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 187, "start": "0:11:40.34", "end": "0:11:43.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有没有真的刺死这种事  裕先生还是可以分辨出来的吧"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 188, "start": "0:11:44.00", "end": "0:11:47.22", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "再说圭一先生的尸体可是仰着倒下的"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 189, "start": "0:11:48.05", "end": "0:11:53.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果你说的是没错  那么圭一先生的尸体应该是以俯卧的姿态被发现的才对"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 190, "start": "0:11:53.68", "end": "0:11:55.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然你说的没错…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 191, "start": "0:11:55.78", "end": "0:11:58.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  你等一下"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 192, "start": "0:11:58.52", "end": "0:12:00.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  如果是那样的话…！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 193, "start": "0:12:02.09", "end": "0:12:03.26", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了？春日？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 194, "start": "0:12:03.90", "end": "0:12:07.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊…唔  没什么"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 195, "start": "0:12:07.21", "end": "0:12:08.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我好像想错了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 196, "start": "0:12:09.20", "end": "0:12:10.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 197, "start": "0:12:10.18", "end": "0:12:11.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂——！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 198, "start": "0:12:11.97", "end": "0:12:14.18", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你们两位没事吧？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 199, "start": "0:12:16.72", "end": "0:12:19.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "结果  春日的推理并不成立"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 200, "start": "0:12:20.26", "end": "0:12:22.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是  这样一来真相究竟是怎么样的呢？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 201, "start": "0:12:23.22", "end": "0:12:26.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在预测死亡的时间  裕先生并不在岛上"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 202, "start": "0:12:26.99", "end": "0:12:29.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那样的话  真正的犯人就是另外的人了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 203, "start": "0:12:30.59", "end": "0:12:31.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嗯？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 204, "start": "0:12:32.04", "end": "0:12:34.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要吃哪个呢～？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 205, "start": "0:12:35.16", "end": "0:12:35.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "嘿嘿～"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 206, "start": "0:12:36.19", "end": "0:12:36.62", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 207, "start": "0:12:36.64", "end": "0:12:37.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呀！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 208, "start": "0:12:37.61", "end": "0:12:40.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚不要吓唬我嘛！真是的"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 209, "start": "0:12:40.50", "end": "0:12:41.58", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你想偷吃吗"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 210, "start": "0:12:42.52", "end": "0:12:44.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为我肚子饿了嘛"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 211, "start": "0:12:45.74", "end": "0:12:48.95", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "久等了  我现在就送到房间里去"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 212, "start": "0:12:49.36", "end": "0:12:50.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "啊  好狡猾！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 213, "start": "0:12:51.03", "end": "0:12:53.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有一个人已经吃过了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 214, "start": "0:12:54.59", "end": "0:12:56.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这是新川的餐点"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 215, "start": "0:12:56.43", "end": "0:12:59.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为新川从早上起就什么都没有吃"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 216, "start": "0:12:59.55", "end": "0:13:00.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以我先给他送去了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 217, "start": "0:13:01.52", "end": "0:13:03.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "别总是给哥哥丢脸"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 218, "start": "0:13:06.72", "end": "0:13:07.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么了？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 219, "start": "0:13:09.65", "end": "0:13:12.15", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有希！是我啊  快开门"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 220, "start": "0:13:12.86", "end": "0:13:15.32", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你曾对我说不论什么人来都不可以开门"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 221, "start": "0:13:15.60", "end": "0:13:17.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "已经可以了  快把门打开！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 222, "start": "0:13:17.55", "end": "0:13:21.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那样的话就会违反「不论什么人来都不能开门」的命令了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 223, "start": "0:13:21.88", "end": "0:13:24.08", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "朝比奈学姐还没醒来吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 224, "start": "0:13:24.54", "end": "0:13:26.80", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "听不到她的声音  恐怕是这样吧"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 225, "start": "0:13:27.16", "end": "0:13:31.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我说的「不论什么人」\n指的是除了我们SOS团之外的「什么人」啊！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 226, "start": "0:13:31.19", "end": "0:13:33.45", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们不是SOS团的同伴吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 227, "start": "0:13:33.67", "end": "0:13:35.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你没有对我说这些"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 228, "start": "0:13:35.42", "end": "0:13:40.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我接受到的指示只是「不论来了什么人  都不能给对方打开这扇门」"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 229, "start": "0:13:40.25", "end": "0:13:43.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "有希在我出去的时候不是也什么都没有说吗"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 230, "start": "0:13:44.02", "end": "0:13:48.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "对于从内侧打开门的情况  我并没有接受到任何指示"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 231, "start": "0:13:48.17", "end": "0:13:48.94", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呜…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 232, "start": "0:13:50.50", "end": "0:13:51.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "喂  长门"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 233, "start": "0:13:51.83", "end": "0:13:54.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在春日的命令解除了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 234, "start": "0:13:55.17", "end": "0:13:58.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不然的话就由我来修改这条命令"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 235, "start": "0:13:58.80", "end": "0:14:00.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我妹妹也在外面  把门打开吧"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 236, "start": "0:14:06.08", "end": "0:14:09.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是的  你听话也要稍微灵活一点嘛"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 237, "start": "0:14:11.97", "end": "0:14:15.31", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "刚才的莫非是…「长门式玩笑」吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 238, "start": "0:14:15.71", "end": "0:14:19.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "拜托啊长门…因为你表情和脸色都完全不变"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 239, "start": "0:14:19.95", "end": "0:14:22.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以只会以为你是认真的啦"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 240, "start": "0:14:22.65", "end": "0:14:24.09", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "谢谢你  有希"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 241, "start": "0:14:24.39", "end": "0:14:25.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "接下来要怎么办？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 242, "start": "0:14:26.34", "end": "0:14:28.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "要继续追查真相吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 243, "start": "0:14:30.42", "end": "0:14:33.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不要了不要了  果然我还是没办法当什么名侦探"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 244, "start": "0:14:34.09", "end": "0:14:35.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "之后就交给警察吧"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 245, "start": "0:14:41.92", "end": "0:14:45.28", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "原来如此  在洞穴里面还发生过这种事"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 246, "start": "0:14:45.55", "end": "0:14:46.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是真奇怪"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 247, "start": "0:14:47.11", "end": "0:14:49.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这么想要玩侦探游戏的家伙"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 248, "start": "0:14:49.82", "end": "0:14:51.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为什么突然改变了态度？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 249, "start": "0:14:52.58", "end": "0:14:56.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我可是知道的哦  凉宫同学的想法"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 250, "start": "0:14:56.98", "end": "0:14:58.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "让我告诉你吧？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 251, "start": "0:14:58.70", "end": "0:14:59.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那我就听听看吧"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 252, "start": "0:15:00.18", "end": "0:15:03.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "凉宫同学作的推理有一半是正确的"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 253, "start": "0:15:03.80", "end": "0:15:05.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "而最后的部分错了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 254, "start": "0:15:06.96", "end": "0:15:11.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "圭一先生被裕先生刺了  但当时并没有立刻身亡"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 255, "start": "0:15:11.90", "end": "0:15:14.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "裕先生错以为杀了人而逃跑了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 256, "start": "0:15:14.47", "end": "0:15:15.92", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "到这里还都是没错的"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 257, "start": "0:15:16.84", "end": "0:15:18.82", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "圭一先生因为我们的声音而醒来"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 258, "start": "0:15:18.87", "end": "0:15:20.47", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "圭一先生？圭一先生？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 259, "start": "0:15:19.47", "end": "0:15:21.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就在我们打算打开门之前"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 260, "start": "0:15:20.85", "end": "0:15:22.16", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果您在的话就请回答！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 261, "start": "0:15:22.19", "end": "0:15:24.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "昏昏沉沉地把门锁上了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 262, "start": "0:15:25.23", "end": "0:15:26.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这个时候…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 263, "start": "0:15:30.77", "end": "0:15:34.96", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "刀子刺进圭一先生体内就是在那个时候"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 264, "start": "0:15:35.74", "end": "0:15:37.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也就是说  犯人是…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 265, "start": "0:15:38.04", "end": "0:15:39.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "撞破房门的人"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 266, "start": "0:15:40.37", "end": "0:15:46.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也就是我  你和新川先生了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 267, "start": "0:15:48.90", "end": "0:15:51.74", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "凉宫同学已经注意到这一点了吧"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 268, "start": "0:15:52.12", "end": "0:15:53.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以她才什么都没说"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 269, "start": "0:15:54.57", "end": "0:16:00.04", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为了保护我们  把真相深藏在自己的心里…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 270, "start": "0:16:00.48", "end": "0:16:03.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "的确道理上可以说得通…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 271, "start": "0:16:05.45", "end": "0:16:08.33", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是被你发现了…可是不大好啊"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 272, "start": "0:16:09.67", "end": "0:16:14.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只要封住你的嘴  这件事就不会被别人知道"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 273, "start": "0:16:14.97", "end": "0:16:16.52", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是这样没错吧"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 274, "start": "0:16:17.11", "end": "0:16:19.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不好了  不好了！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 275, "start": "0:16:21.67", "end": "0:16:24.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉哥哥  古泉哥哥死了！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 276, "start": "0:16:24.61", "end": "0:16:26.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "被人用刀子刺进了胸口…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 277, "start": "0:16:27.33", "end": "0:16:28.46", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "什么？！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 278, "start": "0:16:28.78", "end": "0:16:29.61", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "怎么会！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 279, "start": "0:16:29.72", "end": "0:16:31.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "快点来  快点！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 280, "start": "0:16:31.77", "end": "0:16:32.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这边！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 281, "start": "0:16:40.44", "end": "0:16:42.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没想到你这么坏啊"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 282, "start": "0:16:42.66", "end": "0:16:43.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我不会杀你的"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 283, "start": "0:16:44.21", "end": "0:16:46.24", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只要你能够隐瞒住真相…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 284, "start": "0:16:47.27", "end": "0:16:50.70", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉被偷偷回来的裕先生所杀…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 285, "start": "0:16:50.95", "end": "0:16:52.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然说动机只有本人才知道"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 286, "start": "0:16:53.34", "end": "0:16:56.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是看起来裕先生本来就有这种性癖…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 287, "start": "0:16:56.37", "end": "0:16:57.93", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "大致就是这么一回事了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 288, "start": "0:16:58.11", "end": "0:16:59.97", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "能不能骗过警察呢？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 289, "start": "0:17:00.64", "end": "0:17:04.36", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是为此才要在这具尸体上再插个两三柄小刀"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 290, "start": "0:17:04.57", "end": "0:17:07.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为了令裕先生的异常性表现得更加显著…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 291, "start": "0:17:07.45", "end": "0:17:08.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "来吧！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 292, "start": "0:17:08.20", "end": "0:17:09.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "呜…等一下！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 293, "start": "0:17:14.04", "end": "0:17:15.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "戏剧已经结束了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 294, "start": "0:17:16.01", "end": "0:17:17.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们输了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 295, "start": "0:17:23.95", "end": "0:17:25.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "完全被算计了啊"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 296, "start": "0:17:26.04", "end": "0:17:28.64", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "抱歉啦～是阿虚叫我做的"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 297, "start": "0:17:30.21", "end": "0:17:36.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "好了！现在要发表\n超越常人的天才名侦探·凉宫春日的名推理了！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 298, "start": "0:17:37.07", "end": "0:17:39.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你还真是能自吹自擂啊…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 299, "start": "0:17:40.25", "end": "0:17:44.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不用说  这一切都是古泉和多丸兄弟"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 300, "start": "0:17:44.19", "end": "0:17:45.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "以及新川先生和森小姐"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 301, "start": "0:17:45.84", "end": "0:17:48.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为了捉弄我们演的戏"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 302, "start": "0:17:49.37", "end": "0:17:51.06", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "连假的「真相」都准备好了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 303, "start": "0:17:51.14", "end": "0:17:52.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "准备得很细致嘛"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 304, "start": "0:17:53.08", "end": "0:17:54.39", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "您真是洞若观火啊"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 305, "start": "0:17:54.77", "end": "0:17:58.35", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只是一点余兴节目  本来打算作为惊喜聚会的"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 306, "start": "0:17:58.64", "end": "0:18:01.30", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那家伙一开始就全都知道吧…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 307, "start": "0:18:03.02", "end": "0:18:05.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一开始的确把我骗到了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 308, "start": "0:18:06.06", "end": "0:18:10.98", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "相信了假的真相  以为令圭一先生致死的是把门撞破的阿虚他们"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 309, "start": "0:18:11.59", "end": "0:18:12.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是我注意到了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 310, "start": "0:18:14.20", "end": "0:18:17.25", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果是能把刀子撞进心脏的猛烈撞击"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 311, "start": "0:18:17.43", "end": "0:18:20.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "门上肯定会留下凹槽或者伤痕"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 312, "start": "0:18:21.21", "end": "0:18:23.81", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是  门上却半点伤痕都没有"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 313, "start": "0:18:24.01", "end": "0:18:25.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽然说注意到这一点是我吧"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 314, "start": "0:18:25.57", "end": "0:18:28.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是  这有可能是因为门非常坚固"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 315, "start": "0:18:29.06", "end": "0:18:31.79", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "只是这样还不足以怀疑吧？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 316, "start": "0:18:32.41", "end": "0:18:34.17", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还有其它不合理的事"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 317, "start": "0:18:34.50", "end": "0:18:37.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是古泉见到新川先生时的事"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 318, "start": "0:18:37.68", "end": "0:18:39.41", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "他不是说了「好久不见」吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 319, "start": "0:18:39.67", "end": "0:18:42.83", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "新川他们是一周之前刚刚被雇用的  和古泉应该是初次见面"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 320, "start": "0:18:43.00", "end": "0:18:44.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这么打招呼不是很奇怪吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 321, "start": "0:18:45.36", "end": "0:18:47.05", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "您说得正是"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 322, "start": "0:18:47.29", "end": "0:18:48.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "注意到这个的也是我"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 323, "start": "0:18:49.09", "end": "0:18:52.29", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "还有跑到圭一先生房门前时候的事情"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 324, "start": "0:18:52.61", "end": "0:18:55.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "古泉不是直接跑向了圭一先生的房间了吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 325, "start": "0:18:56.57", "end": "0:18:58.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你为什么会知道房间的位置？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 326, "start": "0:18:58.97", "end": "0:19:01.99", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "明明说过是第一次来这座别墅的…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 327, "start": "0:19:02.32", "end": "0:19:06.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是失态啊  竟然接连犯下错误"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 328, "start": "0:19:06.31", "end": "0:19:08.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是就算知道也不算无法理解"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 329, "start": "0:19:08.29", "end": "0:19:11.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也许他在你们不知道的时候确认过了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 330, "start": "0:19:11.70", "end": "0:19:12.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "的确"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 331, "start": "0:19:12.91", "end": "0:19:16.50", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是决定性的是阿虚在厨房发现的餐点…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 332, "start": "0:19:16.69", "end": "0:19:19.49", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "阿虚  你来说明  我当时并不在场"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 333, "start": "0:19:19.74", "end": "0:19:24.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在我们所有人中使用刀叉用餐的只有圭一先生"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 334, "start": "0:19:24.82", "end": "0:19:28.60", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "当然  新川先生也使用刀叉的可能性并不是没有"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 335, "start": "0:19:28.91", "end": "0:19:31.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "但是问题是  胡萝卜被剩了下来"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 336, "start": "0:19:32.17", "end": "0:19:35.88", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "于是我就想到了  那个会不会是圭一先生的餐点"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 337, "start": "0:19:37.46", "end": "0:19:41.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "把这些事情综合起来考虑的话  结论就只有一个！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 338, "start": "0:19:41.30", "end": "0:19:43.67", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "也就是说  圭一先生还活着！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 339, "start": "0:19:43.73", "end": "0:19:46.68", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一切都是在演戏！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 340, "start": "0:19:49.71", "end": "0:19:52.46", "style": "zhushi", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哇～好厉害哦～！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 341, "start": "0:19:50.81", "end": "0:19:55.02", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "在春日那家伙的脑子里面  一定沸腾着数十倍于此的欢呼声"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 342, "start": "0:19:55.74", "end": "0:19:59.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "所以呢  就轮到我们来演一场戏了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 343, "start": "0:20:00.25", "end": "0:20:03.73", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我看到的你们两位的争吵也是在演戏吧？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 344, "start": "0:20:03.77", "end": "0:20:04.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "就是这样"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 345, "start": "0:20:05.13", "end": "0:20:07.20", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "深夜的那个电话也是一样的"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 346, "start": "0:20:09.24", "end": "0:20:12.16", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "本来打算找个时间自首的"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 347, "start": "0:20:12.29", "end": "0:20:15.13", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "没想到这么快就被拆穿了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 348, "start": "0:20:15.30", "end": "0:20:18.38", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不过  的确你的推理也起到了启发作用"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 349, "start": "0:20:18.62", "end": "0:20:20.44", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真是有名侦探的样子啊"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 350, "start": "0:20:20.72", "end": "0:20:24.51", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "哪里～不过是小菜一碟  华生！"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 351, "start": "0:20:29.24", "end": "0:20:31.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "果然还是你的组织搞的鬼吗"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 352, "start": "0:20:31.96", "end": "0:20:36.89", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "是啊  多丸兄弟  新川先生和森小姐都是我们的同伴"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 353, "start": "0:20:38.04", "end": "0:20:40.53", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "为了让凉宫同学不再突然想到稀奇古怪的点子"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 354, "start": "0:20:40.86", "end": "0:20:44.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我们认为最好能事先为她提供好事件"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 355, "start": "0:20:45.62", "end": "0:20:48.48", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "虽说你妹妹也来了是出乎预料的"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 356, "start": "0:20:48.70", "end": "0:20:53.42", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "去的时候你不是在船上说这次和「机关」没有关系吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 357, "start": "0:20:55.09", "end": "0:20:58.75", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "我也不能真的告诉你啊"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 358, "start": "0:21:00.61", "end": "0:21:03.71", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你是什么时候察觉到真相的？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 359, "start": "0:21:05.23", "end": "0:21:07.76", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "其实在事件一开始的时候就发现了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 360, "start": "0:21:07.93", "end": "0:21:09.03", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "一开始吗…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 361, "start": "0:21:10.14", "end": "0:21:12.23", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "这种事件是不可能发生的…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 362, "start": "0:21:12.61", "end": "0:21:17.40", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "因为春日是不可能真心希望发生杀人事件的"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 363, "start": "0:21:17.73", "end": "0:21:19.11", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "她就是那种人"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 364, "start": "0:21:20.64", "end": "0:21:23.27", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "你很信任凉宫同学呢"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 365, "start": "0:21:28.36", "end": "0:21:29.91", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "再问你一件事"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 366, "start": "0:21:30.18", "end": "0:21:31.59", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "春日看到的可疑黑影"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 367, "start": "0:21:31.92", "end": "0:21:33.57", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那也是你搞的鬼吗？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 368, "start": "0:21:34.02", "end": "0:21:35.12", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "可疑黑影？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 369, "start": "0:21:36.29", "end": "0:21:39.90", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "真的不是  我也没理由继续演戏了"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 370, "start": "0:21:40.65", "end": "0:21:42.77", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "那  那个影子到底是什么？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 371, "start": "0:21:43.48", "end": "0:21:44.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "难道说…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 372, "start": "0:21:45.05", "end": "0:21:50.34", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "看来凉宫同学内心非常希望真正的犯人不在我们之中"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 373, "start": "0:21:50.71", "end": "0:21:53.78", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "如果那个是春日造出来的…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 374, "start": "0:21:56.83", "end": "0:22:01.66", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "现在那座岛上还有不知道是什么的东西躲藏着…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 375, "start": "0:22:02.23", "end": "0:22:03.37", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "不  还是说"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 376, "start": "0:22:03.52", "end": "0:22:05.85", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "毕竟是春日看错了吗…"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 377, "start": "0:22:10.07", "end": "0:22:12.01", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "下次我们去哪里好？"}
{"ep": "11", "idx": 378, "start": "0:22:12.17", "end": "0:22:14.07", "style": "zhengwen", "actor": "NTP", "text": "百慕大三角洲如何？"}
